{"mls":"R1688084","addr":"358 North Shore Road B","muni":"Cuba town","town":"Cuba","county":"Allegany","zip":"14727","ll":[42.254433,-78.288808],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":3,"baths":1,"sqft":1302.0,"year":1927,"lot":0.25,"dom":102,"price":599900,"orig":675000,"chg":"Price Change","tax":7088,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"Howard Hanna Professionals - Olean","phone":"716-378-7039","hhp":true,"remarks":"Some things are worth waiting for, and this is one of them. Nestled along the coveted North Shore of Cuba Lake, this exceptional lakefront retreat doesn't just sit on the water… it belongs here. Beautiful maple trees wrap the property in natural seclusion, creating a world apart from the ordinary, while premium frontage opens onto panoramic lake views stretching as far as the eye can see. Step outside and let Cuba Lake do what it does best. Mornings begin with coffee on the spacious deck as mist rises off the water. Afternoons are spent casting a line, pulling the boat out, or simply floating beneath a wide-open sky. And evenings? The North Shore sunsets here are the kind that make you stop mid-conversation and just stare. This isn't a project, it's a place you can fall in love with immediately. Move-in ready and brimming with classic lake charm, the property blends timeless character with everything you need to start living your best lake life from day one. Well-maintained docks, convenient parking just across the street on a separate lot (153.10-1-33) that is .25 acres and can fit 8-10 cars, and that rare combination of total privacy and breathtaking exposure make this an offering that simply doesn't come around often. Whether you're hosting a full house of family and friends, stealing away for a quiet weekend on the water, or finally putting down roots in the lakeside lifestyle you've always imagined. Cuba Lake at its finest. Yours, if you move fast.","facts":[["Total rooms","6"],["Full baths","1"],["Half baths","0"],["Style","Bung